  "rationale": "Use a minimal plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in small deterministic specifications. The policy gives clear priority to forward progress in clear space, uses short directed turns for side obstacles, uses a rare one-shot backward escape only for front blockage, and reserves full_rotate for a dedicated repeated-failure last-resort path.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion capability in G",
    "Use one policy specification for clear-space progress and obstacle-triggered recovery sequencing",
    "Use a second specification to escalate repeated front blockage to a dedicated last-resort full_rotate state only after multiple failed recoveries"
